app/pullback_test.odin:513-516: '// removal of a routing call turns the suite RED. NOTE: start_run clears pullback // via its destroy-then-reinit run-init independent of the camera routing, so // start_run_wiring_homes_on_the_source_cluster pins ONLY the routing (the // DEFAULT_ZOOM + source-cluster-home asserts) — it does NOT claim to pin'. Falsity verified: `sed -n '874,984p' app/main.odin | grep pullback` returns ZERO matches (start_run's body never writes app.pullback), and `grep -rn "pullback" core/*.odin` returns zero (run_init/run_destroy never touch the App-owned pullback field — pullback_test.odin:10 documents 'the pullback state lives ONLY on App'). The only clear on the start_run path is camera_set_default itself: app/main.odin:1759-1764 'camera_set_default :: proc(app: ^App) {
	app.cam_wx_to = app.home_wx
	app.cam_wy_to = app.home_wy
	app.cam_zoom_to = rnd.DEFAULT_ZOOM
	app.pullback = false
}'.
